// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// LAND STACK — Chennai locality registry.
//
// ONE Chennai-wide environment is made of several localities. Each locality is
// a self-contained cluster of demo parcels / buildings / floors / units +
// governance records, generated by `buildLocality()` in `seed.js`. The frontend
// flies ONE Cesium camera between these localities — it never swaps maps.
//
// Everything here is DEMO DATA using realistic Chennai coordinates. It
// represents no real parcel, building, person or government record.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

